  _showInfo: 1
  _explanation: "When a collision with a bounding volume with tags [Level] starts:\n         
    disables component Charger (OkapiKit.MovementForward)\n          select a random
    velocity between (0.00, 0.00) and (0.00, 0.00) and set it to Charger's rigid
    body.\n          Note that this changes the velocity parameters of the movement,
    not the current velocity.\n          For that, use the 'Change Rigid Body' action.\n         
    enables component Charger (OkapiKit.MovementFollow)\n"
